    "USB-C iPhone: a USB-C → HDMI cable (or a USB-C cable to a monitor with a USB-C video input). Lightning iPhone: Apple's Lightning → HDMI adapter. No cable: Control Center → Screen Mirroring → an Apple TV, an AirPlay TV or a Mac. Laptop: the “Use a laptop as the display” button.": {
