    "“%@” is not installed into APLite yet. iOS only runs code inside an installed app: tap the box button → “Install new apps into APLite”, pick ESign (or your signing app), then sign and install as usual. Reopen APLite and it runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "vi": {
